LRC14 Tanner/dessin/weak-regularity carrier audit
==============================================================================
Vertex challenge:
  tested vertices: moment rows, missed-depth atoms, signed edges,
  equitable quotient classes, dessin half-edges, unit-distance graph lenses.
  chosen carrier: moment rows r and atoms t, edge iff r<=t.
  preserved predicate: THM-534 Delsarte dominance g(t)>=scale*[t=0].
  destroyed data: generated speed words, relation lattice, L7 residue odometer.
